{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s","cat":"event","group":{"id":"ev40107","label":"GOOD WORLD"},"label":"A World Built by Good People: A","stage":null,"prev":"event_goodworld_05_e","next":"event_goodworld_06_e","speakers":{"snowcrane":"Snow Crane"},"icons":{"snowcrane":"si_c620_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_1","text":"A long, long time ago,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Park_n","bgArt":"park_n","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_signal","movie":null,"shown":["snowcrane"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_2","text":"when the Raptures had only just begun to invade the surface,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_3","text":"there were two big forces: the United Forces of Humanity, a government military that fought the Raptures,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_4","text":"and a group known as V.T.C., a religious order that possessed advanced scientific technology.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_5","text":"Those two forces joined hands to fight the Raptures,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_6","text":"but around the time they finally accepted defeat and decided to retreat to the Ark,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_7","text":"the United Forces of Humanity made a major decision.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_8","text":"In order to secure the technology they lacked so that they could better govern the Ark,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_9","text":"they chose to merge with V.T.C. and take on a new name: the Central Government.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_10","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_10","text":"Ah, so that's when they started calling it that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_11","text":"That's right. Many people believe the merger was the end result of a power struggle between the two,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_12","text":"but I think they simply decided that neither side could defeat the Raptures on their own.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_13","text":"When that agreement was reached,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_14","text":"the two sides each presented their conditions for the merger.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_15","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_15","text":"What were the conditions?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_16","text":"V.T.C. wanted to continue the research they had conducted on the surface,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_17","text":"so they entered into an agreement with Missilis Industry,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_18","text":"forming the independent research institute known as M.M.R.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_19","text":"Meanwhile, the United Forces of Humanity wanted to develop technology that would help humankind,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_20","text":"so they requested that V.T.C. share its miraculous scientific advances.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_21","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_21","text":"Technology that would help humankind...?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_22","text":"Yes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_23","text":"There were many more conditions besides those,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_24","text":"but those are the two biggest ones I'm able to mention at the moment.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_25","text":"Also, when representatives from each party gathered,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_26","text":"the following statement was added to the agreement:","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_27","text":"\"This agreement has been made under the supervision of Veiled Order, a squad that exists to serve as witness to contracts.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_28","text":"\"Should either of the two parties violate any of the aforementioned terms,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_29","text":"they may be suppressed by force.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_30","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_30","text":"!!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_31","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_31","text":"Wait... Were you there when this agreement was made?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_32","text":"Yes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_33","text":"I was there both to witness the agreement and to observe that the contract is upheld.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_34","text":"That was one of the many reasons I remained underground until now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_35","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_35","text":"... I see.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_36","text":"In regards to one of those \"technologies that would help humankind,\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_37","text":"you may have heard me refer to someone as \"you-know-who\" earlier. They offered themselves up as a test subject,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_38","text":"in exchange for getting M.M.R. to begin a particular research project:","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_39","text":"Project A.D., the very same one you're interested in.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_40","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_40","text":"Who is this person...?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_41","text":"Someone who dreamed of making the world a better place.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_42","text":"They wanted the Ark to serve as the starting point for that, so they embarked on many different endeavors.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_43","text":"Project A.D. was one of those.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_44","text":"Also, I just thought of one more thing connected to Project A.D.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_45","text":"You've heard it mentioned many times today.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_46","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_46","text":"I have?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_47","text":"Yes. The miracle drug that extends the human lifespan:","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_48","text":"Evergreen.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_49","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_49","text":"!!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_50","text":"This person was able to get it mass-produced...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_51","text":"... as a direct result of their involvement in this project.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_52","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_52","text":"So... Evergreen is related to Project A.D.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_53","text":"They were a really great person.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_sceneofmemory","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_54","text":"Not only did they kick-start Project A.D.,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_55","text":"but even the contract that you helped me wrap up today was one of the many good things they did for the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_56","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_06_s_56","text":"By which you mean... they established the foundation you've been talking about?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_06_s_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_go